      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>Qevelta de-Liba’i (“My Heart’s Lament”) is a melancholy song I wrote in Targumic Judeo-Aramaic in 2010. This piece is an existential peek into an old man’s private moment. He looks in the mirror and waxes wistful, longing for his bygone youth.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_45905_introduction"/>
